{"underlines":[{"text":"sat trying to eat","id":"3748:727","kind":"action","range":[727,17],"sentence":3748,"decidedBy":"model","reference":{"text":"CHAPTER SIXTEEN","paragraph":1650,"sentence":3742,"range":[0,15]},"paragraph":1652},{"text":"is faithfulness itself","id":"3752:78","kind":"thing","range":[78,22],"sentence":3752,"decidedBy":"model","reference":{"text":"CHAPTER SIXTEEN","paragraph":1650,"sentence":3742,"range":[0,15]},"paragraph":1654},{"text":"go to Mr. Laurence","id":"3758:88","kind":"action","range":[88,18],"sentence":3758,"decidedBy":"model","reference":{"text":"“Children, I leave you to Hannah’s care and Mr. Laurence’s protection.","paragraph":1654,"sentence":3751,"range":[0,70]},"paragraph":1656},{"text":"waved their hands","id":"3772:151","kind":"action","range":[151,17],"sentence":3772,"decidedBy":"model","reference":{"text":"They kissed their mother quietly, clung about her tenderly, and tried to wave their hands cheerfully when she drove away.","paragraph":1658,"sentence":3766,"range":[327,121]},"paragraph":1661},{"text":"is to us","id":"3773:19","kind":"thing","range":[19,8],"sentence":3773,"decidedBy":"model","reference":{"text":"Hannah is faithfulness itself, and our good neighbor will guard you as if you were his own.","paragraph":1654,"sentence":3752,"range":[71,91]},"paragraph":1662},{"text":"began with the good omens of sunshine, smiles, and cheerful words","id":"3776:141","kind":"action","range":[141,65],"sentence":3776,"decidedBy":"model","reference":{"text":"As she rolled away, the sun came out, and looking back, she saw it shining on the group at the gate like a good omen.","paragraph":1661,"sentence":3771,"range":[0,117]},"paragraph":1663},{"text":"worked for them","id":"3779:189","kind":"action","range":[189,15],"sentence":3779,"decidedBy":"model","reference":{"text":"Go on with your work as usual, for work is a blessed solace.","paragraph":1654,"sentence":3755,"range":[375,60]},"paragraph":1666},{"text":"came to the rescue","id":